{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Magnetic Radius, more commonly known as Magnetism, is a statistic that indicates how far away from the player an object can be before it is automatically taken into inventory. Higher magnetic radius means objects can be further away from the player and be automatically collected."]]]],["Rings",2,[["p",["The following ",["l","戒指","rings"]," affect magnetism."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Effect"]},{"h":1,"v":["Where to Find"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["f","Small_Magnet_Ring.png",48]],[["l","小型磁铁戒指","Small Magnet Ring"]],["Slightly increases your radius for collecting items."],["Increases ",["f","Magnetism.png",24]," ",["l","磁性","Magnetism"]," by one tile. Stacks with itself, the normal ",["l","磁铁戒指","Magnet Ring"],", and the ",["l","铱环","Iridium Band"],"."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Reward for completing the Boiler Room"]],[1,[["f","Fishing_Treasure_Chest.png",24]," ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"]]],[1,["Destroying various barrels and boxes in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]]]]]]},["N/A"],["50g"]],[[["f","Magnet_Ring.png",48]],[["l","磁铁戒指","Magnet Ring"]],["Increases your radius for collecting items."],["Increases ",["f","Magnetism.png",24]," ",["l","磁性","Magnetism"]," by two tiles. Stacks with itself, the ",["l","小型磁铁戒指","Small Magnet Ring"],", and the ",["l","铱环","Iridium Band"],"."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,["Enemy drops in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]," between floors 40-79"]],[1,["Destroying various barrels and boxes in ",["l","矿井","The Mines"]]]]]]},["N/A"],["100g"]],[[["f","Glowstone_Ring.png",48]],[["l","辉石戒指","Glowstone Ring"]],["Emits a constant light, and also increases your radius for collecting items."],["Combines the effect of the ",["l","光辉戒指","Glow Ring"],", and the ",["l","磁铁戒指","Magnet Ring"],"."],{"b":[["l",0,[[1,[["l","打造","Crafting"]," with ",["f","Mining_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采矿","Mining"]," Level 4"]],[1,["Can be purchase